 = 1$, find its intercepts with the $x$-axis."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186124900 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "fb7148a2-58cc-5023-845c-435b47e31c83" :knowledge-point/title "Finding Traces of Elliptic Cones"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "fc3f777a-8154-5f8e-82e8-5a1f5a53f9a3" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186121971} {:answer/id #uuid "07c9aea4-325f-592d-9e7a-9d6c5d16fea9" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "9" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186121972} {:answer/id #uuid "1c8bdaf3-6ae4-5b1c-869a-03c7d439d0e5" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "8" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186121973} {:answer/id #uuid "2c7939b2-7ea7-5e6c-9ca3-e6c556ab2691" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186121974} {:answer/id #uuid "6cc1deed-cc2f-55a7-94c6-10734889c712" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "16" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186121975}] :answer-field/id #uuid "d4de7975-5011-59e8-9c71-cc5dcb39301b" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186121970}] :question/id #uuid "65b5aaee-5eaf-5370-809f-ff7bd458f787" :question/math-academy-id "q-35620" :question/problem "Given that the intersection of the elliptic cone $3(x + 4)^{2} + 8y^{2} = 12z^{2}$ and the plane $z =-2$ is an ellipse, what is the length of its major axis?"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186124911 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "b1a557d6-52f3-5df3-8088-5b875296e72e" :knowledge-point/title "Finding the Pivot Columns of a Matrix"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "edf31528-154d-5036-a970-e4ca91cb017f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$1$st and $3$rd only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186122037} {:answer/id #uuid "f4bff001-041e-5115-9b97-148bb00b96ff" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/te